:42Z"},{"number":50,"title":"Rank Tracking Page - Add paginated domain keyword discovery ","comments":4,"created_at":"2026-06-30T01:07:21Z"},{"number":373,"title":"Connect Umami as an analytics source alongside Google Analytics","comments":2,"created_at":"2026-09-30T04:56:44Z"},{"number":247,"title":"Plugin install fails: manifest key \"displayName\" is rejected","comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-26T03:17:40Z"},{"number":224,"title":"Add GoAnyAPI as an optional data provider","comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:08:35Z"},{"number":210,"title":"Rank tracking: pluggable SERP provider, so self-hosters can cut the per-check cost","comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-09T23:00:14Z"}],"discussions":[],"latest_release":{"name":"v0.1.27","tag":"v0.1.27","published_at":"2026-11-11T18:19:38Z","body":"Delete Local SEO businesses and change their area, Lighthouse results over MCP, and more complete site audits.\n\n## What's new\n\n- Delete a tracked business or change its area in Local SEO\n- Read Lighthouse results with the new `get_audit_lighthouse` MCP tool\n- Audits that stop at their page limit now say so\n- `finalUrls` option on `get_serp_results` for page URLs instead of Google redirect links\n  - Takes a few minutes instead of seconds\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Site audits that hit their page limit no longer use it up on tag pages and skip pages in your sitemap.\n- Site audits no longer report a site's bot-check page as the real page.\n- Keyword Research shows the keyword you searched in the overview card.\n- `get_local_rank_grid` no longer counts a similarly named business as yours when you give its cid.\n\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/every-app/open-seo/compare/v0.1.26...v0.1.27\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"OpenSEO 在 Cloudflare 上的自托管部署：一条命令搞定 D1/KV/R2 与 Cloudflare Access 登录门禁","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00014/article/details/165221830","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-09-13"},{"title":"开源SEO工具open-seo